{"id":"level-up-2026-10-09","name":"2026-10-09 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1051","en":"The report examines the cumulative effect of repeated delays.","zh":"报告研究了多次延误产生的累积影响。","note":"cumulative · 积累的， 渐增的 · a cumulative effect","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1052","en":"The top storey of the building contains three small studios.","zh":"这栋楼的顶层有三间小工作室。","note":"storey · 楼层 · the top storey","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1053","en":"She wrote the address on a small slip of paper.","zh":"她把地址写在一张小纸片上。","note":"slip · 滑倒，失足；减退；摆脱，闪开；塞入；差错， 疏漏； 滑倒； 纸片 · a slip of paper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1054","en":"The survey recorded a rare species near the river.","zh":"调查在河边记录到一种稀有物种。","note":"species · 种， 物种 · a rare species","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1055","en":"The boat dropped anchor in a sheltered bay overnight.","zh":"船夜间在一处避风海湾抛锚停泊。","note":"anchor · 抛锚； 使固定， 系牢； 使基于； 主持；锚；给人安全感的人；精神支柱；顶梁柱 · drop anchor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1056","en":"I could follow the logic of her argument easily.","zh":"我能轻松理解她论证中的逻辑。","note":"logic · 逻辑； 逻辑学 · follow the logic","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1057","en":"His poor eyesight made the tiny map labels difficult to read.","zh":"他视力不好，很难看清地图上的小字标签。","note":"eyesight · 视力 · poor eyesight","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1058","en":"The recipe uses a little spice to balance the sweetness.","zh":"食谱用了少量香料来平衡甜味。","note":"spice · 香料，调味品；使增添趣味； 往…加香料 · add spice","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1059","en":"The photographs appeared on a large screen behind the speaker.","zh":"照片出现在演讲者身后的大屏幕上。","note":"screen · 屏幕， 银幕； 遮蔽； 屏风， 帘； 筛子；掩蔽， 遮蔽； 包庇； 筛选； 放映， 播放 · a cinema screen","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1060","en":"The sign says visitors can pay by MasterCard or cash.","zh":"标志说明游客可以用万事达卡或现金付款。","note":"MasterCard · 万事达信用卡 · pay by MasterCard","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1061","en":"The tiny markings are difficult to see with the naked eye.","zh":"这些细小痕迹很难用肉眼看清。","note":"naked · 裸体的， 无遮蔽的 · the naked eye","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1062","en":"She felt homesick during her first week at university.","zh":"上大学的第一周，她很想家。","note":"homesick · 想家的， 思乡的 · feel homesick","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1063","en":"The library introduced longer opening hours for a trial period.","zh":"图书馆试行了一段时间的延长开放。","note":"trial · 试验性的；审讯；试验 · a trial period","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1064","en":"The survey explores public perception of the proposed transport changes.","zh":"调查探讨了公众对拟议交通调整的看法。","note":"perception · 看法； 感觉； 洞察力 · public perception","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1065","en":"The report examines the environmental costs of resource exploitation.","zh":"报告研究了资源开发的环境代价。","note":"exploitation · 开采， 开发； 剥削， 榨取； 自私的利用 · resource exploitation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1066","en":"The students will undertake research in the local history archive.","zh":"学生们将在地方历史档案馆开展研究。","note":"undertake · 承担， 负起责任； 同意或答应做某事 · undertake research","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1067","en":"The designers wanted a short, pronounceable name for their new product.","zh":"设计师们想为新产品取一个简短、易发音的名字。","note":"pronounceable · 发得出的； 可发音的 · an easily pronounceable name","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1068","en":"The garden features indigenous plants adapted to the local climate.","zh":"花园主要种植适应本地气候的乡土植物。","note":"indigenous · 土产的， 本地的， 本土的 · indigenous plants","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1069","en":"The tourist bureau provided a map of nearby walking routes.","zh":"旅游局提供了一张附近步行路线的地图。","note":"bureau · 办公室； 机构； 局； 处； 所 · a tourist bureau","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1070","en":"As an introvert, she preferred small gatherings to crowded parties.","zh":"作为内向的人，她更喜欢小型聚会，而不是拥挤的派对。","note":"introvert · 性格内向的人 · a quiet introvert","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1071","en":"The seedlings need moist soil while their roots develop.","zh":"幼苗长根时需要湿润的土壤。","note":"moist · 湿润的， 潮湿的 · moist soil","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1072","en":"I left the charging cable beside my desk at home.","zh":"我把充电线落在家里的书桌旁了。","note":"cable · 发电报；缆绳；电缆；电报 · a charging cable","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1073","en":"A nasty smell came from the forgotten lunch container.","zh":"被遗忘的饭盒里散发出难闻的气味。","note":"nasty · 令人讨厌的； 不友好的， 恶意的， 下流的； 恶劣的 · a nasty smell","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1074","en":"There was intense competition for places on the summer course.","zh":"暑期课程名额的竞争非常激烈。","note":"intense · 强烈的， 剧烈的； 紧张的； 热情的， 热切的 · intense competition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1075","en":"My thrifty aunt repairs clothes instead of replacing them.","zh":"我节俭的姨妈会修补衣服，而不是换新的。","note":"thrifty · 节俭的， 节约的 · a thrifty household","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1076","en":"The estate includes woodland, gardens, and a small working farm.","zh":"这座庄园包括林地、花园和一个仍在经营的小农场。","note":"estate · 个人财产， 遗产； 土地， 地产， 庄园 · a country estate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1077","en":"He played an acoustic guitar beside the café window.","zh":"他坐在咖啡馆窗边弹奏原声吉他。","note":"acoustic · 原声的； 声音的； 听觉的 · an acoustic guitar","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1078","en":"The proposal needs further elaboration before the committee can assess it.","zh":"提案还需要进一步阐述，委员会才能评估。","note":"elaboration · 精心之作； 详尽阐述 · further elaboration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1079","en":"The old door has a polished brass handle.","zh":"旧门上有一个擦得锃亮的黄铜把手。","note":"brass · 黄铜； 黄铜器； 铜管乐器 · a brass handle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1080","en":"The new design underwent rigorous testing before production began.","zh":"新设计在投产前经过了严格测试。","note":"rigorous · 严密的； 严格的， 严厉的； 严酷的 · rigorous testing","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1081","en":"Press the green button to activate the audio guide.","zh":"按绿色按钮启动语音导览。","note":"activate · 激活； 使活动， 使活化 · activate a device","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1082","en":"The hilltop café offers an unbeatable view of the bay.","zh":"山顶咖啡馆拥有无与伦比的海湾景色。","note":"unbeatable · 无敌的， 不可战胜的 · an unbeatable view","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1083","en":"My supervisor suggested narrowing the scope of the research.","zh":"我的导师建议缩小研究范围。","note":"supervisor · 监督人， 管理人， 指导者； 主管 · a research supervisor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1084","en":"A low wall marks the boundary between the two gardens.","zh":"一道矮墙标出了两个花园之间的界线。","note":"boundary · 分界线； 边界 · a boundary wall","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1085","en":"Her supportive colleagues helped her settle into the new role.","zh":"支持她的同事们帮助她适应了新岗位。","note":"supportive · 支持的， 支援的； 赞助的； 鼓励的； 同情的 · a supportive colleague","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1086","en":"The identity of the portrait's subject remains an enigma.","zh":"肖像中人物的身份仍然是个谜。","note":"enigma · 谜， 谜一样的人或事 · remain an enigma","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1087","en":"The speaker faced a barrage of questions after the presentation.","zh":"演讲结束后，发言人面对一连串问题。","note":"barrage · 弹幕射击； 火力网 · a barrage of questions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1088","en":"The magician performed a simple trick with three coloured cards.","zh":"魔术师用三张彩色纸牌表演了一个简单戏法。","note":"trick · 诡计，花招；欺诈， 哄骗 · a clever trick","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1089","en":"The drawing shows the delicate structure of a fish's gill.","zh":"这幅图展示了鱼鳃精细的结构。","note":"gill · 鳃 · a fish gill","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1090","en":"The introduction will define the key terms used throughout the report.","zh":"引言将界定报告全文使用的关键术语。","note":"define · 下定义； 限定 · define a term","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1091","en":"Please make a photocopy of the completed application form.","zh":"请把填好的申请表复印一份。","note":"photocopy · 影印，复印；影印本， 复印件 · make a photocopy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1092","en":"The missing cable could render the entire sound system useless.","zh":"缺少的电缆可能让整套音响系统无法使用。","note":"render · 使得， 致使； 给予， 以…回报； 提供； 呈报， 递交； 表达； 表演； 翻译 · render useless","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1093","en":"The old railway once carried goods across the frontier.","zh":"这条老铁路曾经承担跨境货运。","note":"frontier · 边境，边界；开发地区的边缘地带； · cross a frontier","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1094","en":"The report contains a manifest error in its final calculation.","zh":"报告的最后一项计算存在一个明显错误。","note":"manifest · 明显的；表明，显示；货物清单 · a manifest error","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1095","en":"The photograph shows a buffalo standing in a flooded field.","zh":"照片展示了一头站在积水田里的水牛。","note":"buffalo · 水牛； 野牛 · a water buffalo","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1096","en":"The extra volunteers helped relieve pressure on the museum staff.","zh":"增派的志愿者帮助减轻了博物馆员工的压力。","note":"relieve · 救济； 缓解 · relieve pressure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1097","en":"The lesson moves from concrete examples towards mathematical abstraction.","zh":"这节课从具体例子逐步转向数学抽象。","note":"abstraction · 抽象 · mathematical abstraction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-09:s1098","en":"The collector showed us a clear piece of quartz.","zh":"收藏者给我们看了一块透明的石英。","note":"quartz · 石英 · a quartz crystal","recordings":[]},{"id":"cat